%% Title: Bronze Write Sequence (JSONL + zstd)
%% Covers: RULES.md §2.1 (Bronze Layer), §2.2 (Append-Only), application/core batch processing
%% Updated: 2026-08-21
%% Components: BatchProcessingService, BronzeWriter, prepare_bronze_write, zstd stream write, metadata/audit side effects

%% @version 1.1.0
%% @date    2026-08-21
%% @type    sequenceDiagram
%% @level   Mixed (System / Component / Class)
%% @nodes   7
%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': {'lineWidth': '2'}}}%%
%% @uniform sequence width=176 max_title_len=18
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Processing as BatchProcessingService
    participant Writer as BronzeWriter
    participant Prepare as prepare_bronze_write()
    participant Compressor as zstd + atomic file write
    participant Storage as Local FS
    participant Metadata as Metadata/Audit side effects
    participant Obs as Tracing + Metrics

    Note over Processing,Writer: Phase 1: Bronze stage entry

    Processing->>Writer: write_bronze(records, batch_id, ingestion_ts, source_metadata)
    activate Writer
    Writer->>Obs: start span "write_bronze"<br/>increment bronze_write_attempts_total

    Note over Writer,Prepare: Phase 2: Normalize request

    Writer->>Prepare: _prepare_bronze_write(request)
    activate Prepare
    Note right of Prepare: Validate names and UTC timestamps<br/>Optionally validate JSON records<br/>Build relative path + metadata
    Prepare-->>Writer: BronzeWritePrepared
    deactivate Prepare

    Note over Writer,Storage: Phase 3: Stream-compress and persist

    Writer->>Compressor: _write_bronze_data_and_sidecar(prepared)
    activate Compressor
    Compressor->>Storage: write temp .jsonl.zst
    Storage-->>Compressor: temp file path
    Compressor->>Compressor: stream zstd chunks
    Compressor->>Storage: atomic rename to final batch path
    Storage-->>Compressor: file persisted

    opt save_json=True
        Compressor->>Storage: write JSONL debug copy
        Storage-->>Compressor: JSON copy persisted
    end

    Compressor-->>Writer: record_count + sizes
    deactivate Compressor

    Note over Writer,Metadata: Phase 4: Post-write side effects

    Writer->>Metadata: _run_bronze_post_write_actions(...)
    activate Metadata
    Metadata->>Storage: checksum / stat / metadata path resolution
    Metadata->>Metadata: build BronzeWriteResult

    opt audit enabled
        Metadata->>Metadata: log bronze audit entry
    end

    opt metadata enabled
        Metadata->>Storage: write bronze metadata sidecar
    end

    Metadata-->>Writer: BronzeWriteResult
    deactivate Metadata

    Note over Writer,Obs: Phase 5: Final telemetry

    Writer->>Obs: observe bronze_write_total_duration_seconds
    Writer-->>Processing: BronzeWriteResult
    deactivate Writer

    rect rgb(255, 240, 245)
        Note over Writer,Storage: Failure semantics
        Note right of Writer: Temp file is removed on write failure.<br/>No lock validation happens inside BronzeWriter.<br/>Atomic rename prevents partial final files.
    end
